SUMMARY:Feast of the Senses
DESCRIPTION:Feast of the Senses is Touchstone Foundation’s signature annual event and auction benefiting youth mental wellness in Lancaster County. This immersive evening invites guests to experience food\, art\, and music through thoughtfully curated sensory stations\, each representing a Touchstone program and the impact it creates for youth in our community. \n\n\n\nGuests will enjoy seasonal cuisine\, interactive experiences\, a silent and live auction\, and powerful stories of impact from students and families served through Touchstone’s programs\, including mental health access assistance\, mentorship through Rise Above\, student career exploration\, and clinical fellowships. \n\n\n\nProceeds from the evening help remove financial barriers to therapy\, connect youth with trusted mentors\, and support the next generation of mental health professionals serving Lancaster County. \n\n\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable evening that engages the senses and supports a mission that changes lives.
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/feast-of-the-senses/
LOCATION:Excelsior\, 125 East King Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Dining,Fundraiser
