SUMMARY:DVS Conference: Building a Community of Care
DESCRIPTION:Domestic violence impacts every sector of community life—from education and healthcare to housing\, employment\, and public safety. \n\n\n\nThe 2026 DVS Conference: Building a Community of Care brings together practitioners\, advocates\, educators\, legal professionals\, healthcare providers\, and community partners to examine how domestic violence intersects with the systems and structures that shape people’s daily lives. \n\n\n\nThis one-day conference will explore practical\, cross-sector strategies\, highlight emerging trends\, and strengthen collective approaches that support survivors through holistic\, integrated care. Attendees will leave with tools\, insights\, and connections that help build safer\, more responsive communities. \n\n\n\nHosted by Community Action Partnership of Lancaster CountyDate: Wednesday\, May 20\, 2026Location: The Ware Center\, 42 N Prince St\, Lancaster\, PA 17603 \n\n\n\nEARLY BIRD TICKETS ARE AVAILABLE!Our conference will feature 12 incredible guest presenters across three breakout sessions\, with four diverse workshop options to choose from during each session. Attendees can tailor their experience while exploring meaningful topics and fresh perspectives. The day will also include a live panel discussion and an inspiring keynote from Casey Keene\, LMSW—all designed to spark ideas\, connection\, and real change. \n\n\n\nRegister by Wednesday\, April 15 for the early-bird price of $65/person. \n\n\n\nLearn more and purchase tickets here! \n\n\n\nThe schedule for the day is as follows: \n\n\n\n8:00 am – Doors open8:30 am  – Breakfast9:00 am – Keynote9:30 am – Community Needs Assessment Panel10:45 am – Session One12:00 pm – Lunch12:45 pm – Session Two2:15 pm – Session Three3:15 pm – Closing RemarksFor any further questions or information\, don’t hesitate to reach out: \n\n\n\nContact: Fai Hammond\, DVS Community Outreach Coordinator\, Community Action Partnership of Lancaster County at fhammond@caplanc.org
URL:https://visitlancastercity.com/event/dvs-conference-building-a-community-of-care/
LOCATION:The Ware Center\, 42 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Classes and Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://visitlancastercity.com/wp-content/uploads/cityoflancasterpa-242134369851055-6502652161316776967-2026-DVS-Conference-1200-x-485-px.png
